{"title":"广东省项目管理协会数智监理委员会正式成立！","date":"2025-04-03","content":"<h1 class=\"rich_media_title \" id=\"activity-name\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px 0px 14px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; font-weight: 500; font-size: 22px; line-height: 1.4; user-select: text; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); font-family: &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0.544px; white-space-collapse: collapse; text-align: center;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:24px;\">广东省项目管理协会数智监理委员会正式成立！</span></h1>\r\n<section class=\"article135\" data-role=\"outer\" label=\"edit by 135editor\">\r\n\t<section data-color=\"#1e9be8\" style=\"margin-top: 10px; margin-bottom: 10px; letter-spacing: 0.578px; font-size: 16px; text-align: center; height: 0px;\">\r\n\t\t&nbsp;</section>\r\n\t<section data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\" data-role=\"outer\" label=\"edit by 135editor\">\r\n\t\t<section class=\"_135editor\" data-id=\"99058\" data-tools=\"135编辑器\">\r\n\t\t\t<section style=\"margin: 10px 0px;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"display: flex;justify-content: flex-start;align-items: flex-end;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"font-size: 40px;color:#ff0000;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p leaf=\"\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"margin-top: -0px;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"padding: 0px;background:#eaf5fe;border-radius: 10px;box-sizing:border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<section data-width=\"17%\" style=\"padding: 3px;background: #ff0000;width: 17%;border-radius: 10px;height: 6px;box-sizing:border-box;max-width:17% !important;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p leaf=\"\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<section data-autoskip=\"1\" style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 1.75em; letter-spacing: 1.5px; font-size: 17px; color: rgb(255, 0, 0); padding: 10px 0px; box-sizing: border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"vertical-align: initial; line-height: 1.75em; text-indent: 2.11764em;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"letter-spacing: 1px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">2025年3月31日下午，由广东省项目管理协会主办、广东省项目管理协会数智监理委员会筹办、广州市广州工程建设监理有限公司承办的&ldquo;广东省项目管理协会数智监理委员会成立大会&rdquo;在广州胜利召开。广东省项目管理协会会长赖铭华、副秘书长戴晓伟、标准化委员会主任余建平、智造建筑委员会主任郑松、机电工程委员会副主任陈耿权、数智科技委员会副主任庄承荣等多位领导嘉宾，数智监理委员会发起人王倩倩以及各委员单位代表、个人委员出席大会。</span></p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<section data-width=\"100%\" style=\"max-width: 100% !important;width: 100%;box-sizing:border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<section class=\"_135editor\" data-id=\"157624\" data-tools=\"135编辑器\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"margin: 10px auto;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<section data-width=\"100%\" nodeleaf=\"\" style=\"width: 100%;max-width:100% !important;box-sizing:border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-backh=\"385\" data-backw=\"578\" data-croporisrc=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/gMfAEWd6akhXcOjtAwr4EHAa9k3Dphks5I5tLCCOpsav5DyohNpIta0qA0gQBcGNqJWQJ55jwuzXLd20NvNQ1w/0?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\" data-cropselx2=\"578\" data-cropsely2=\"341\" data-imgfileid=\"100013843\" data-ratio=\"0.6666666666666666\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"jpeg\" data-w=\"1080\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://www.gpma.org.cn/userfiles/1/images/cms/article/202504/1-1.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; display: block; vertical-align: baseline; box-sizing: border-box;\" /></section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<section data-width=\"100%\" style=\"width: 100%;height: 3px;background: linear-gradient(to right,#fea6a6 0%,#fea6a6 12.5%,#28b2fe 12.5%,#28b2fe 25%,#fea6a6 25%,#fea6a6 37.5%,#28b2fe 37.5%,#28b2fe 49.5%,#fea6a6 49.5%,#fea6a6 62%,#28b2fe 62%,#28b2fe 75%,#fea6a6 75%,#fea6a6 87.5%,#28b2fe 87.5%,#28b2fe 100%);max-width:100% !important;box-sizing:border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p leaf=\"\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"background-color: #f6fcff;padding: 10px 10px;box-sizing:border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<section data-autoskip=\"1\" style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 1.75em; letter-spacing: 1.5px; background-color: transparent;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align:center;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"letter-spacing: 1px; font-size: 15px;\">广东省项目管理协会赖铭华会长致辞</span></p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align:center;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"line-height: 1.75em; text-indent: 2.11764em; font-size: 17px;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"color: black; letter-spacing: 1px;\">赖铭华会长在致辞中表示，2025年是&ldquo;十四五&rdquo;规划的收官之年，也是全国两会胜利闭幕后的新起点，全国两会和广东省高质量发展大会为数智监理委员会的成立和发展提供了强大的动力和方向指引。他强调，随着信息技术的飞速发展和国家经济进入高质量发展阶段，数字化、智能化转型已成为各行各业发展的必然趋势，工程建设监理行业作为传统行业的重要组成部分，其数智化转型势在必行。因此，协会成立数智监理委员会，不仅是响应国家战略、顺应时代发展的必然选择，更是监理行业自身转型升级、提质增效的迫切需求。</span></p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t<section class=\"_135editor\" data-id=\"157624\" data-tools=\"135编辑器\">\r\n\t\t\t<section style=\"margin: 10px auto;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<section data-width=\"100%\" nodeleaf=\"\" style=\"width: 100%;max-width:100% !important;box-sizing:border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-backh=\"385\" data-backw=\"578\" data-croporisrc=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/gMfAEWd6akhXcOjtAwr4EHAa9k3DphksOsBickic6diaYbrQJYFsbicwxMN1cFzywxxB5l4zLmIS0lUf5ibtQ2MRGsA/0?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\" data-cropselx2=\"578\" data-cropsely2=\"341\" data-imgfileid=\"100013846\" data-ratio=\"0.6666666666666666\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1080\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://www.gpma.org.cn/userfiles/1/images/cms/article/202504/1-2.png\" style=\"width: 100%; display: block; vertical-align: baseline; box-sizing: border-box;\" /></section>\r\n\t\t\t\t<section data-width=\"100%\" style=\"width: 100%;height: 3px;background: linear-gradient(to right,#fea6a6 0%,#fea6a6 12.5%,#28b2fe 12.5%,#28b2fe 25%,#fea6a6 25%,#fea6a6 37.5%,#28b2fe 37.5%,#28b2fe 49.5%,#fea6a6 49.5%,#fea6a6 62%,#28b2fe 62%,#28b2fe 75%,#fea6a6 75%,#fea6a6 87.5%,#28b2fe 87.5%,#28b2fe 100%);max-width:100% !important;box-sizing:border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<p leaf=\"\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t<section style=\"background-color: #f6fcff;padding: 10px 10px;box-sizing:border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<section data-autoskip=\"1\" style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 1.75em; letter-spacing: 1.5px; background-color: transparent;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align:center;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"letter-spacing: 1px; font-size: 15px;\">数智监理委员会成立大会会议现场</span></p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p align=\"justify\" style=\"margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 25px;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p align=\"justify\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em; margin-bottom: 10px; text-indent: 2.11764em; font-size: 17px;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"color: black; letter-spacing: 1px;\">会上，戴晓伟副秘书长宣读了《关于同意成立数智监理委员会的批复》。大会依据协会章程和分支机构管理制度等有关规定，经民主投票，最终选举产生数智监理委员会主任委员1人、副主任委员4人、委员13人。</span></p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p align=\"justify\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em; margin-bottom: 10px; text-indent: 2.11764em; font-size: 17px;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t随后，大会<span style=\"letter-spacing: 1px;\">举行揭牌仪式。赖铭华会长和与会嘉宾共同为数智监理委员会揭牌，为当选的主任委员、副主任委员及委员颁发证书。</span></p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t<section class=\"_135editor\" data-id=\"157624\" data-tools=\"135编辑器\">\r\n\t\t\t<section style=\"margin: 10px auto;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<section data-width=\"100%\" nodeleaf=\"\" style=\"width: 100%;max-width: 100% !important;text-align: center;box-sizing:border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-croporisrc=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/gMfAEWd6akhXcOjtAwr4EHAa9k3DphksDExObuBU4BGhMfR54DwUDAHEpDAWGNqqzCX1PHVq4XZcaT2sxiaXdXw/0?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\" data-cropselx2=\"578\" data-cropsely2=\"386\" data-imgfileid=\"100013855\" data-ratio=\"0.6666666666666666\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"jpeg\" data-w=\"1080\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://www.gpma.org.cn/userfiles/1/images/cms/article/202504/1-3.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; display: block; vertical-align: baseline; box-sizing: border-box;\" /></section>\r\n\t\t\t\t<section data-width=\"100%\" style=\"width: 100%;height: 3px;background: linear-gradient(to right,#fea6a6 0%,#fea6a6 12.5%,#28b2fe 12.5%,#28b2fe 25%,#fea6a6 25%,#fea6a6 37.5%,#28b2fe 37.5%,#28b2fe 49.5%,#fea6a6 49.5%,#fea6a6 62%,#28b2fe 62%,#28b2fe 75%,#fea6a6 75%,#fea6a6 87.5%,#28b2fe 87.5%,#28b2fe 100%);max-width:100% !important;box-sizing:border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<p leaf=\"\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t<section style=\"background-color: #f6fcff;padding: 10px 10px;box-sizing:border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<section data-autoskip=\"1\" style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 1.75em; letter-spacing: 1.5px; font-size: 15px; background-color: transparent;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align:center;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"letter-spacing: 1px;\">数智监理委员会揭牌仪式</span></p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t<section class=\"_135editor\" data-id=\"157624\" data-tools=\"135编辑器\">\r\n\t\t\t<section style=\"margin: 10px auto;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<section data-width=\"100%\" nodeleaf=\"\" style=\"width: 100%;max-width: 100% !important;text-align: center;box-sizing:border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-croporisrc=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/gMfAEWd6akhXcOjtAwr4EHAa9k3DphksK5Aa50aSCKia9HLDkPSfF0bWRLLTdtexEsdS7qCJyD4gxDQ4fibRMrqQ/0?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\" data-cropselx2=\"578\" data-cropsely2=\"371\" data-imgfileid=\"100013856\" data-ratio=\"0.6666666666666666\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"jpeg\" data-w=\"1080\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://www.gpma.org.cn/userfiles/1/images/cms/article/202504/1-4.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; display: block; vertical-align: baseline; box-sizing: border-box;\" /></section>\r\n\t\t\t\t<section data-width=\"100%\" style=\"width: 100%;height: 3px;background: linear-gradient(to right,#fea6a6 0%,#fea6a6 12.5%,#28b2fe 12.5%,#28b2fe 25%,#fea6a6 25%,#fea6a6 37.5%,#28b2fe 37.5%,#28b2fe 49.5%,#fea6a6 49.5%,#fea6a6 62%,#28b2fe 62%,#28b2fe 75%,#fea6a6 75%,#fea6a6 87.5%,#28b2fe 87.5%,#28b2fe 100%);max-width:100% !important;box-sizing:border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<p leaf=\"\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t<section style=\"background-color: #f6fcff;padding: 10px 10px;box-sizing:border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<section data-autoskip=\"1\" style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 1.75em; letter-spacing: 1.5px; font-size: 15px; background-color: transparent;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align:center;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"letter-spacing: 1px;\">颁证仪式</span></p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t<section class=\"_135editor\" data-id=\"157624\" data-tools=\"135编辑器\">\r\n\t\t\t<section style=\"margin: 10px auto;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<section data-width=\"100%\" nodeleaf=\"\" style=\"width: 100%;max-width: 100% !important;text-align: center;box-sizing:border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-croporisrc=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/gMfAEWd6akhXcOjtAwr4EHAa9k3DphksWEHaU58NQgwQibw4icYGfPUl9fCdvx0sFVZ7Zez1Dsa4vGcf1ICvMnDQ/0?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\" data-cropselx2=\"578\" data-cropsely2=\"377\" data-imgfileid=\"100013857\" data-ratio=\"0.6453703703703704\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1080\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://www.gpma.org.cn/userfiles/1/images/cms/article/202504/1-5.png\" style=\"width: 100%; display: block; vertical-align: baseline; box-sizing: border-box;\" /></section>\r\n\t\t\t\t<section data-width=\"100%\" style=\"width: 100%;height: 3px;background: linear-gradient(to right,#fea6a6 0%,#fea6a6 12.5%,#28b2fe 12.5%,#28b2fe 25%,#fea6a6 25%,#fea6a6 37.5%,#28b2fe 37.5%,#28b2fe 49.5%,#fea6a6 49.5%,#fea6a6 62%,#28b2fe 62%,#28b2fe 75%,#fea6a6 75%,#fea6a6 87.5%,#28b2fe 87.5%,#28b2fe 100%);max-width:100% !important;box-sizing:border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<p leaf=\"\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t<section style=\"background-color: #f6fcff;padding: 10px 10px;box-sizing:border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<section data-autoskip=\"1\" style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 1.75em; letter-spacing: 1.5px; background-color: transparent;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align:center;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"letter-spacing: 1px; font-size: 15px;\">颁证仪式</span></p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align:center;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p align=\"justify\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em; text-indent: 2.11764em; font-size: 17px;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"letter-spacing: 1px;\">当选主任委员王倩倩在就职讲话中指出，</span><span style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">高质量发展是全面建设社会主义现代化国家的首要任务，监理行业必须加快数智化转型步伐，以适应建筑业提质增效、转型升级的迫切需求。她表示，建筑业作为国民经济的重要支柱，正加速向智能化、绿色化方向发展，传统的监理服务模式已难以满足数智化工程建设和高质量发展的要求，如果不打破固有思维，不融入新发展理念，监理行业将失去生存空间，因此监理行业的数智化转型不仅是技术升级，更是生存与发展的必然选择。数智监理委员会将秉持&quot;服务会员、推动发展&quot;的宗旨，集思广益，推动行业创新与协同，助力会员单位锻长板、补短板、固基业，共同实现协会的目标与任务。</span></p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t<section class=\"_135editor\" data-id=\"157624\" data-tools=\"135编辑器\">\r\n\t\t\t<section style=\"margin: 10px auto;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<section data-width=\"100%\" nodeleaf=\"\" style=\"width: 100%;max-width:100% !important;box-sizing:border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-backh=\"385\" data-backw=\"578\" data-croporisrc=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/gMfAEWd6akhXcOjtAwr4EHAa9k3Dphks8zEQ8ZLDxxIo8IXpXY6gIR5qPLiaJuAb9wffcj0O8Ye5pcxaImwFnSw/0?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\" data-cropselx2=\"578\" data-cropsely2=\"341\" data-imgfileid=\"100013847\" data-ratio=\"0.6666666666666666\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"jpeg\" data-w=\"1080\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://www.gpma.org.cn/userfiles/1/images/cms/article/202504/1-6.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; display: block; vertical-align: baseline; box-sizing: border-box;\" /></section>\r\n\t\t\t\t<section data-width=\"100%\" style=\"width: 100%;height: 3px;background: linear-gradient(to right,#fea6a6 0%,#fea6a6 12.5%,#28b2fe 12.5%,#28b2fe 25%,#fea6a6 25%,#fea6a6 37.5%,#28b2fe 37.5%,#28b2fe 49.5%,#fea6a6 49.5%,#fea6a6 62%,#28b2fe 62%,#28b2fe 75%,#fea6a6 75%,#fea6a6 87.5%,#28b2fe 87.5%,#28b2fe 100%);max-width:100% !important;box-sizing:border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<p leaf=\"\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t<section style=\"background-color: #f6fcff;padding: 10px 10px;box-sizing:border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<section data-autoskip=\"1\" style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 1.75em; letter-spacing: 1.5px; background-color: transparent;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align:center;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"letter-spacing: 1px; font-size: 15px;\">数智监理委员会王倩倩主任讲话</span></p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align:center;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p align=\"justify\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em; text-indent: 2.17647em; font-size: 17px;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t数智监理委员会的成立，标志着监理行业迈入了高质量发展的新阶段。未来，委员会将以创新为驱动，以技术为支撑，以服务为宗旨，凝聚行业智慧，汇聚优质资源，推动监理行业在数智化浪潮中勇立潮头。我们坚信，在全体会员的共同努力下，监理行业必将迎来更加智能化、规范化和可持续的发展未来，为全面建设社会主义现代化国家贡献更大力量。</p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t<section class=\"_135editor\" data-id=\"157624\" data-tools=\"135编辑器\">\r\n\t\t\t<section style=\"margin: 10px auto;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<section data-width=\"100%\" nodeleaf=\"\" style=\"width: 100%;max-width:100% !important;box-sizing:border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-backh=\"379\" data-backw=\"578\" data-croporisrc=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/gMfAEWd6akhXcOjtAwr4EHAa9k3Dphksgwl0wk24oYoMJHIclyO0pibDndqYHaG1Gny3V0xobUXmhldURaDIPKg/0?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\" data-cropselx2=\"578\" data-cropsely2=\"341\" data-imgfileid=\"100013848\" data-ratio=\"0.6555555555555556\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1080\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://www.gpma.org.cn/userfiles/1/images/cms/article/202504/1-7.png\" style=\"width: 100%; display: block; vertical-align: baseline; box-sizing: border-box;\" /></section>\r\n\t\t\t\t<section data-width=\"100%\" style=\"width: 100%;height: 3px;background: linear-gradient(to right,#fea6a6 0%,#fea6a6 12.5%,#28b2fe 12.5%,#28b2fe 25%,#fea6a6 25%,#fea6a6 37.5%,#28b2fe 37.5%,#28b2fe 49.5%,#fea6a6 49.5%,#fea6a6 62%,#28b2fe 62%,#28b2fe 75%,#fea6a6 75%,#fea6a6 87.5%,#28b2fe 87.5%,#28b2fe 100%);max-width:100% !important;box-sizing:border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<p leaf=\"\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t</section>\r\n\t</section>\r\n\t<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;\">\r\n\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t<section style=\"margin-bottom: 0px; letter-spacing: 5px; text-align: center; caret-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-size: 12px; color: rgb(160, 160, 160); font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n\t\t<section style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin-bottom: 0px; outline: 0px; text-align: left; line-height: 1.6em; visibility: visible;\">\r\n\t\t\t&nbsp;</section>\r\n\t\t<section style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin-bottom: 0px; outline: 0px; text-align: left; line-height: 1.6em; visibility: visible;\">\r\n\t\t\t&nbsp;</section>\r\n\t\t<section style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin-bottom: 0px; outline: 0px; text-align: left; line-height: 1.6em; visibility: visible;\">\r\n\t\t\t<p>\r\n\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t\t</section>\r\n\t</section>\r\n</section>\r\n<p>\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>"}